  m_text: "\u2022 Applied Thrust: F = 10.0 N\n\u2022 Cart A (1.0 kg): a = 10.0 m/s\xB2\n\u2022
    Cart B (5.0 kg): a = 2.0 m/s\xB2\n\u2022 Ratio a_A / a_B = 5.0x\n\u2022 Observation:
    a directly proportional to F / m."
