  m_text: '<b>UNIFIED SYNTHESIS:</b> Together, Newton''s Three Laws form the bedrock
    of classical physics: state conservation (1st), dynamical calculation (2nd),
    and momentum balance (3rd) across all physical systems in our universe.'
